<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Leigh &mdash; Computer Science student</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #000000;
    --ink-soft: #4D4D4D;
    --paper: #FFFFFF;
    --paper-raised: #FFFFFF;
    --accent: #000000;
    --accent-deep: #333333;
    --line: #D9D9D9;
    --glow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.045);
    --max: 1100px;
  }
 
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
 
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
 
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 0.5em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
 
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem); }
  h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
 
  p { max-width: 62ch; color: var(--ink-soft); }
 
  a { color: var(--accent-deep); }
 
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
 
  .wrap {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
 
  /* Header */
  .site-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--paper);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
  }
 
  .site-header .wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 22px;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
  }
 
  .logo {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
 
  .menu-toggle {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    margin: -6px;
    padding: 6px;
    color: var(--ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
 
  .menu-panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    right: 0;
    min-width: 160px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: var(--paper-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 8px 0;
    z-index: 20;
  }
 
  .menu-panel[hidden] { display: none; }
 
  .menu-panel a {
    padding: 10px 20px;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
 
  .menu-panel a:hover { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); }
 
  /* Hero */
  .hero { padding: 88px 0 96px; }
 
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.5vw, 5.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }
 
  .hero p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
 
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }
 
  .button:hover { background: var(--accent-deep); }
 
  /* Sections */
  section {
    padding: 72px 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
 
  section::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -160px;
    left: 50%;
    width: 380px;
    height: 380px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
 
  section > .wrap {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
 
  .services { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
 
  .project-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
 
  .project-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 26px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FAFAFA 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.04), 0 10px 24px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.06);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
 
  .project-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.05), 0 16px 36px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.10);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
 
  .project-meta {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
 
  .project-card h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.35em; }
  .project-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0 0 14px; }
 
  .project-card a {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--accent-deep);
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
 
  /* Research placeholder */
  .research-note { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
 
  .placeholder-note {
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 40px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
 
  .placeholder-note p {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
 
  /* Footer */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 32px 0;
  }
 
  footer .wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
 
  footer a { color: var(--ink-soft); }
 
  /* Motion */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero .wrap { animation: rise 0.6s ease both; }
    @keyframes rise {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  }
 
  /* Research page intro */
  .research-intro { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 0; }
 
  /* Upload dropzone */
  .uploads { padding-top: 24px; }
 
  .dropzone {
    border: 1.5px dashed rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.18);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FBFAF6 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.04), 0 10px 28px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.07);
    padding: 48px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
 
  .dropzone.is-dragover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: #FBF7EE;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.05), 0 12px 30px rgba(192, 138, 46, 0.16);
  }
 
  .dropzone p { margin: 0 auto 16px; }
 
  .dropzone input[type="file"] { display: none; }
 
  .file-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 28px auto 0;
    padding: 0;
    max-width: 480px;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
 
  .file-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom: 6px;
  }
 
  .file-list li .file-name { color: var(--ink); }
 
  .upload-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 20px auto 0;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
 
  /* Project grid */
  .projects { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
 
  .project-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
 
  .project-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 26px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FBFAF6 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.04), 0 10px 24px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.06);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
 
  .project-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.05), 0 16px 36px rgba(23, 35, 31, 0.10);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
 
  .project-meta {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
 
  .project-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35em; }
  .project-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0 0 14px; }
 
  .project-card a {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--accent-deep);
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 1px;
  }
 
  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .project-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .hero { padding: 56px 0 64px; }
    section { padding: 52px 0; }
    .dropzone { padding: 36px 18px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="logo" href="#about">leigh</a>
    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="menu-panel">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
        <line x1="3" y1="7" x2="21" y2="7"></line>
        <line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line>
        <line x1="3" y1="17" x2="21" y2="17"></line>
      </svg>
    </button>
    <nav class="menu-panel" id="menu-panel" hidden>
      <a href="research.html">Research</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#project-showcase">Project Showcase</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
 
<main>
 
  <section class="hero" id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>about</h1>
      <p>Currently studying Computer Science. I am diving into the AI, VR, and quantum computing systems that are reshaping the way we live. With these research and projects I am learning the fundamentals, and staying on top about what's next. This site is where I share that process as it unfolds.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
 
  <section class="services" id="project-showcase">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Project Showcase</h2>
      <div class="project-grid">
        <div class="project-card">
          <span class="project-meta">AI</span>
          <h3>Project title one</h3>
          <p>A short line describing this project.</p>
          <a href="research.html">View project</a>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <span class="project-meta">VR</span>
          <h3>Project title two</h3>
          <p>A short line describing this project.</p>
          <a href="research.html">View project</a>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <span class="project-meta">Quantum Computing</span>
          <h3>Project title three</h3>
          <p>A short line describing this project.</p>
          <a href="research.html">View project</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
 
  <section class="research-note" id="research">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Research</h2>
      <div class="placeholder-note">
        <p>This section is ready for you to fill in with research notes, updates, or links.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
 
</main>
 
<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Leigh.</p>
    <p><a href="#about">Back to top</a></p>
  </div>
</footer>
 
<script>
  (function () {
    var toggle = document.getElementById('menu-toggle');
    var panel = document.getElementById('menu-panel');
    toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var isHidden = panel.hidden;
      panel.hidden = !isHidden;
      toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(isHidden));
    });
    document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      if (!panel.hidden && !panel.contains(e.target) && !toggle.contains(e.target)) {
        panel.hidden = true;
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      }
    });
  })();
</script>
 
</body>
</html>
